@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - ATM System

[*] --> Arrival

state "Arrival" as Arrival
state "PIN Verification" as PINVerification
state "Invalid Card or PIN" as InvalidCardOrPin
state "Options Displayed" as OptionsDisplayed
state "Request Processing" as RequestProcessing
state "Cancel Operation" as CancelOperation

Arrival --> PINVerification : User arrives and inserts card
PINVerification --> PINVerification : Repeats until correct PIN is entered
PINVerification --> InvalidCardOrPin : Too many incorrect attempts or invalid card
PINVerification --> OptionsDisplayed : Correct PIN entered

InvalidCardOrPin --> InvalidCardOrPin : Repeats if user tries again
InvalidCardOrPin --> CancelOperation : User cancels operation
OptionsDisplayed --> RequestProcessing : User selects option and requests processing
RequestProcessing --> [*] : Request processed successfully
CancelOperation --> [*] : Operation cancelled

@enduml
